  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.4: Patch Release\n- NEW: Progress reporting infrastructure for long-running quantum operations\n- NEW: IProgressReporter interface added to QRNG, constraint solving, tree search, and VQC training\n- IMPROVED: QuantumDistributions API now supports progress callbacks for batch sampling operations\n- IMPROVED: Enhanced observability for quantum machine learning training loops\n- IMPROVED: Better feedback for large-scale constraint satisfaction and search problems\n- FIXED: Updated test suite to support new progress reporting API (1426+ tests passing)\n- BREAKING: sampleManyWithBackend now requires progressReporter parameter (pass None for no reporting)\n- BREAKING: TreeSearchProblem, ConstraintProblem, and VQC.TrainingConfig now include ProgressReporter field\n- Status: 1426+ tests passing in main package, production-ready",
